  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>After fighting at your side for so long, your eidolon has become as devoted to protecting you and your allies as they are to their original cause. Your eidolon gains a 20-foot devotion aura. Whenever one of your eidolon's allies (including you) within the aura takes damage, you can reduce the damage by 6. You lose a number of Hit Points equal to half the amount by which the eidolon reduced the damage, rounded down. If the damage was lower than 6, base the damage you take on the actual amount of damage prevented. For instance, if the eidolon prevented 5 damage, you would lose 2 HP.</p>"
    },
